.Dd November 1, 2026
.Dt SOXI 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm soxi
.Nd show audio file information
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl T
.Op Fl t | r | c | s | d | D | b | B | e | a
.Ar file ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
runs sox_ng's information mode, also available as
.Cm sox --i .
With no option it prints each file's type, channel count, sample rate,
precision, duration, size, bit rate and encoding, where known.
Options select one field:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl t
File type.
.It Fl r
Sample rate in Hz.
.It Fl c
Channel count.
.It Fl s
Number of samples per channel.
.It Fl d
Duration as hours, minutes and seconds.
.It Fl D
Duration in seconds.
.It Fl b
Bits per sample.
.It Fl B
Average bit rate.
.It Fl e
Encoding name.
.It Fl a
File comments.
.It Fl T
With a duration or sample count option, print the total for all files.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
soxi take.wav
soxi -D take.wav
.Ed
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr play 1 ,
.Xr rec 1 ,
.Xr sox 1
